purpose operation greatestCommonDivisorSignedInt64 "Greatest common divisor via the Euclidean algorithm. Works on absolute values, so signs of inputs don't matter."
invariant operation greatestCommonDivisorSignedInt64 "gcd(a, 0) == |a|; gcd(0, b) == |b|; gcd(0, 0) == 0 (mathematical convention)."
guarantee greatestCommonDivisorSignedInt64 "Total over CSignedInt64."
