call resolveRightAbsCall absoluteSignedInt64
argument resolveRightAbsCall inputValue CSignedInt64 rightValue
run resolveRightAbsCall
bind value gcdRightAbsolute CSignedInt64 resolveRightAbsCall
memory greatestCommonDivisorSignedInt64 mutable gcdDividend I64 0
memory greatestCommonDivisorSignedInt64 mutable gcdDivisor I64 0
set memory gcdDividend gcdLeftAbsolute
set memory gcdDivisor gcdRightAbsolute
label gcdEuclidLoop
