async clampSignedInt64ToInclusiveRange no
purpose operation clampSignedInt64ToInclusiveRange "Returns lowerBound if inputValue < lowerBound, upperBound if inputValue > upperBound, else inputValue."
invariant operation clampSignedInt64ToInclusiveRange "Output is always in [lowerBound, upperBound] when lowerBound <= upperBound."
warning clampSignedInt64ToInclusiveRange "If lowerBound > upperBound, the result is either bound depending on input â€” caller should pre-check."
guarantee clampSignedInt64ToInclusiveRange "Total."
label startClampSignedInt64ToInclusiveRange
call detectInputBelowLowerCall math.lessThanI64
argument detectInputBelowLowerCall left I64 inputValue
argument detectInputBelowLowerCall right I64 lowerBound
run detectInputBelowLowerCall
bind value inputBelowLowerBoundForClamp Bool detectInputBelowLowerCall
branch if condition inputBelowLowerBoundForClamp target returnClampLower
call detectInputAboveUpperCall math.greaterThanI64
argument detectInputAboveUpperCall left I64 inputValue
argument detectInputAboveUpperCall right I64 upperBound
run detectInputAboveUpperCall
bind value inputAboveUpperBoundForClamp Bool detectInputAboveUpperCall
branch if condition inputAboveUpperBoundForClamp target returnClampUpper
return value inputValue
label returnClampLower
return value lowerBound
label returnClampUpper
return value upperBound

# ============================================================
